@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = paste-admin-access-token

### 1. Who's free? (the seed puts Peter and Brian on duty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/riders/available
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Create the delivery job and assign a rider in one go
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/jobs/delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderNumber": "ORD-261020-00001", "riderId": "PASTE-RIDER-ID" }

### 3. Rider leaves → order DISPATCHED, stock SOLD, OTP generated for the customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/jobs/JOB-261020-00001/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Delivered (photo proof until Step 13 SMSes the OTP to customers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/jobs/JOB-261020-00001/delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "PHOTO", "photoUrl": "https://example.com/pod.jpg", "recipientName": "Jane" }

### 5. COD only: count the rider's cash (id from this list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/cod?status=OUTSTANDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/cod/PASTE-COD-ID/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "handedOverCents": 260000 }

### 7. What do we owe the rider?
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/riders/PASTE-RIDER-ID/earnings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
